| **D06** | T2 11/05 | Reliability — Sentry / Crashlytics / error boundary / release | 3 Q&A Topic 6, có release process kể được end-to-end |
| **D07** | T3 12/05 | Testing (pyramid, RNTL, what NOT to test, mocks) | 3 Q&A Topic 7, có 1 lý do honest "tại sao Firegroup ít test" |
